# Per-Dockerfile ignore (BuildKit reads <dockerfile>.dockerignore before the context's .dockerignore).
#
# Both images build from the repo root so that shared/ is inside the context — but the browser build
# has no use for the server's 132MB of slideshow music, and sending it on every build would trade a
# shared file for a much slower pipeline. The web image needs web/ and shared/ and nothing else.
*
!web/
!shared/

# …minus the parts of web/ that must never be in an image.
web/node_modules
web/.svelte-kit
web/build
web/e2e
web/.camtest
**/.env
**/.env.*
